{"seq":2,"slug":"cssom-and-style-computation","title":"CSSOM 与样式计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/dom-and-cssom/cssom-and-style-computation","wordCount":635,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"cssom-与样式计算\">CSSOM 与样式计算</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>浏览器解析 CSS 生成 <strong>CSSOM 树</strong>，再与 DOM 树结合为每个元素计算出最终样式。CSS 属性值依次经过 <strong>Specified → Computed → Used</strong> 三个阶段转换；当多条规则冲突时，<strong>层叠算法</strong>按来源与重要性、选择器优先级（Specificity）、源码顺序裁决。选择器匹配<strong>从右向左</strong>进行，越简洁的右侧选择器匹配成本越低。</p>\n<h2 id=\"css-解析流程\">CSS 解析流程</h2><p>浏览器在构建 DOM 的同时，会并行解析 CSS 样式表，构建 <strong>CSSOM（CSS Object Model）</strong>。CSSOM 是 CSS 的结构化表示，和 DOM 树配合完成渲染树的构建。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    CSS[&quot;CSS 文本&quot;] --&gt; Tokenize[&quot;词法分析&quot;]&#10;    Tokenize --&gt; Parse[&quot;语法分析&quot;]&#10;    Parse --&gt; Rules[&quot;样式规则树&quot;]&#10;    Rules --&gt; CSSOM[&quot;CSSOM 树&quot;]&#10;    DOM[&quot;DOM 树&quot;] --&gt; Combine[&quot;样式计算&quot;]&#10;    CSSOM --&gt; Combine&#10;    Combine --&gt; Computed[&quot;每个元素的\\nComputed Style&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    CSS[\"CSS 文本\"] --&gt; Tokenize[\"词法分析\"]\n    Tokenize --&gt; Parse[\"语法分析\"]\n    Parse --&gt; Rules[\"样式规则树\"]\n    Rules --&gt; CSSOM[\"CSSOM 树\"]\n    DOM[\"DOM 树\"] --&gt; Combine[\"样式计算\"]\n    CSSOM --&gt; Combine\n    Combine --&gt; Computed[\"每个元素的\\nComputed Style\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"css-值的三个阶段\">CSS 值的三个阶段</h2><p>每个 CSS 属性在计算过程中经历三个阶段的值转换：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Specified Value（指定值）</td>\n<td>声明的原始值或继承/初始值</td>\n<td><code>width: 50%</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Computed Value（计算值）</td>\n<td>解析相对值为绝对值</td>\n<td><code>width: 50%</code>（仍保持百分比）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Used Value（使用值）</td>\n<td>最终用于布局的实际像素值</td>\n<td><code>width: 400px</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const element = document.querySelector&lt;HTMLElement&gt;(&#39;.box&#39;)!;&#10;&#10;const computedStyle = getComputedStyle(element);&#10;console.log(&#39;font-size:&#39;, computedStyle.fontSize);&#10;console.log(&#39;color:&#39;, computedStyle.color);&#10;console.log(&#39;width:&#39;, computedStyle.width);&#10;&#10;console.log(&#39;所有计算属性数量:&#39;, computedStyle.length);&#10;&#10;for (let i = 0; i &lt; 5; i++) {&#10;  const prop = computedStyle.item(i);&#10;  console.log(`${prop}: ${computedStyle.getPropertyValue(prop)}`);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HTMLElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.box'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> computedStyle</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getComputedStyle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(element);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'font-size:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, computedStyle.fontSize);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'color:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, computedStyle.color);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'width:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, computedStyle.width);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'所有计算属性数量:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, computedStyle.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prop</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> computedStyle.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prop</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">computedStyle</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getPropertyValue</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prop</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"层叠解析-cascade-resolution\">层叠解析（Cascade Resolution）</h2><p>当多条规则同时作用于一个元素时，浏览器通过<strong>层叠算法</strong>决定最终的属性值。层叠的优先级从高到低：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Origin[&quot;1. 来源与重要性&quot;]&#10;    Origin --&gt; Specificity[&quot;2. 选择器优先级&quot;]&#10;    Specificity --&gt; Order[&quot;3. 源码顺序&quot;]&#10;&#10;    subgraph Origins[&quot;来源优先级 (高→低)&quot;]&#10;        T1[&quot;过渡声明&quot;]&#10;        UA_I[&quot;用户代理 !important&quot;]&#10;        User_I[&quot;用户 !important&quot;]&#10;        Author_I[&quot;作者 !important&quot;]&#10;        Anim[&quot;动画声明&quot;]&#10;        Author[&quot;作者样式&quot;]&#10;        User[&quot;用户样式&quot;]&#10;        UA[&quot;用户代理样式&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    Origin[\"1. 来源与重要性\"]\n    Origin --&gt; Specificity[\"2. 选择器优先级\"]\n    Specificity --&gt; Order[\"3. 源码顺序\"]\n\n    subgraph Origins[\"来源优先级 (高→低)\"]\n        T1[\"过渡声明\"]\n        UA_I[\"用户代理 !important\"]\n        User_I[\"用户 !important\"]\n        Author_I[\"作者 !important\"]\n        Anim[\"动画声明\"]\n        Author[\"作者样式\"]\n        User[\"用户样式\"]\n        UA[\"用户代理样式\"]\n    end</pre><p>选择器优先级（Specificity）的计算规则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选择器类型</th>\n<th>权重 (A, B, C)</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ID 选择器</td>\n<td>(1, 0, 0)</td>\n<td><code>#header</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类/属性/伪类选择器</td>\n<td>(0, 1, 0)</td>\n<td><code>.nav</code>, <code>[type=&quot;text&quot;]</code>, <code>:hover</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>元素/伪元素选择器</td>\n<td>(0, 0, 1)</td>\n<td><code>div</code>, <code>::before</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通配符/组合器</td>\n<td>(0, 0, 0)</td>\n<td><code>*</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>+</code>, <code>~</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Specificity {&#10;  a: number;&#10;  b: number;&#10;  c: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function calculateSpecificity(selector: string): Specificity {&#10;  const spec: Specificity = { a: 0, b: 0, c: 0 };&#10;&#10;  const withoutPseudoElements = selector.replace(/::[a-zA-Z-]+/g, () =&gt; {&#10;    spec.c++;&#10;    return &#39;&#39;;&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  const idMatches = withoutPseudoElements.match(/#[a-zA-Z_-][a-zA-Z0-9_-]*/g);&#10;  spec.a = idMatches?.length ?? 0;&#10;&#10;  const classMatches = withoutPseudoElements.match(/\\.[a-zA-Z_-][a-zA-Z0-9_-]*/g);&#10;  const attrMatches = withoutPseudoElements.match(/\\[[^\\]]+\\]/g);&#10;  const pseudoClassMatches = withoutPseudoElements.match(/:[a-zA-Z-]+/g);&#10;  spec.b = (classMatches?.length ?? 0) + (attrMatches?.length ?? 0) + (pseudoClassMatches?.length ?? 0);&#10;&#10;  const elementMatches = withoutPseudoElements.match(/(?:^|[\\s&gt;+~])([a-zA-Z][a-zA-Z0-9]*)/g);&#10;  spec.c += elementMatches?.length ?? 0;&#10;&#10;  return spec;&#10;}&#10;&#10;console.log(calculateSpecificity(&#39;#nav .item a&#39;));&#10;console.log(calculateSpecificity(&#39;.btn.btn--primary&#39;));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Specificity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateSpecificity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">selector</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Specificity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> spec</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Specificity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { a: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, b: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, c: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> withoutPseudoElements</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> selector.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">replace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F